{"title":"The B2B Collective Networking Event >>> Thrive & Connect ","startsAt":"2026-11-19T18:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-19T20:30:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"The B2B Collective NETWORKING NIGHT\n\nConnect • Collaborate • Thrive\n👉Building Relationships That Build Businesses\n[https://B2B111926.eventbrite.ca](https://b2b111926.eventbrite.ca/)\n\nThe B2B Collective Networking Night is a monthly gathering designed to help entrepreneurs, professionals, and business owners expand their network, exchange ideas, create strategic partnerships, and access valuable business resources.\n\nEach event features:\n✅ Structured Networking\n✅ Business Spotlights\n✅ Expert Education & Resources\n✅ Referral Opportunities\n✅ Community Connections\n\nWhether you're launching a new business, scaling an existing company, or looking to build meaningful professional relationships, you'll find valuable connections and opportunities at The B2B Collective.\n\nNOVEMBER TOPIC:\nBecome the Go-To Expert in Your Industry: The Power of Personal Branding\nIn a crowded marketplace, your personal brand is what sets you apart. People want to do business with experts they know, trust, and remember.\n\nJoin us at The B2B Collective Networking Night as we explore how to build a powerful personal brand that attracts opportunities, establishes credibility, and positions you as the go-to expert in your field.\n\n💡 You'll Learn How To:\n✅ Increase your visibility and stand out from the competition\n✅ Position yourself as a trusted authority in your industry\n✅ Optimize your LinkedIn profile to attract clients and connections\n✅ Build credibility through content, networking, and thought leadership\n✅ Create a consistent personal brand that opens doors to new opportunities\n\nWhether you're an entrepreneur, consultant, sales professional, or business owner, your personal brand can be one of your most valuable business assets.\n\n🤝 Connect with local professionals, entrepreneurs, and business leaders who are committed to growing their influence, expanding their network, and elevating their brand.\n\nThursday, Nov 19th, 2026\n📅 3rd Thursday of Every Month\n🕡 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM\n📍EMPOWERED4X Coworking Office - 350 Rutherford Rd S, Brampton (Suite #104)\n(Look for the GLASS Building PLAZA II - main floor beside washrooms - across from Playdium - NOT the Brown Building - go to PLAZA II GLASS Building)\n💵 $10 investment\n🎁 Returning Guest Perk – Free raffle entry for a biz-boosting gift.\n(Bring a Gift and receive a Business Spotlight)\n✨ RSVP now >>> [https://B2B111926.eventbrite.ca](https://b2b111926.eventbrite.ca/)\nSeating is LIMITED to 25 people.\n\\*1st 10 People to Register are FREE to attend.\n\n🎟️ Reserve your spot today!\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\nA BIG thank you to our venue sponsor, Empowered 4X!\nThis event is brought to you by:\nThe Black Women Collective, Jelly Social and Empowered 4x\nThank you for supporting our community!\nCHECK OUT OUR WEBSITE: [www.jellysocial.ca](http://www.jellysocial.ca/)\nCHECK OUT EMPOWERED FOR X COWORKING: [https://empowered4x.com/](https://empowered4x.com/)\nCHECK OUT THE BLACK WOMEN COLLECTIVE: [https://many.bio/_thebwcglobal](https://many.bio/_thebwcglobal)\n\nFor More Info please contact: Amanda @ 416.320.025\n\n\\*\\*\\*\\*\nShort Event Summary\n\nBecome the Go-To Expert in Your Industry\n\nLearn how to increase your visibility, strengthen your professional presence, optimize LinkedIn, and build authority in your market. Connect with entrepreneurs and professionals while discovering practical strategies to create a personal brand that attracts opportunities and drives business growth. 🚀✨","venue":{"name":"Empowered4x","address":"350 Rutherford Road South, Plaza 2 - Unit 104, Brampton","lat":43.68214,"lng":-79.71676,"city":"Brampton"},"fee":null,"group":"Networking Night in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/7/7/highres_534363191.jpeg"}